# Offline single-file builds, and any check copy of one.
#
# `build:offline` is `--mode full` on purpose: the offline foldbox carries the cut half
# (machine table, kerf compensation, the DXF writer). That is fine as a deliverable and wrong
# in this repo, which is public AND is the live site.
#
# A 940 KB `_offline-check.html` sat in `public/` from 75a2066 until 2026-09-09. `public/` is
# copied verbatim into `dist/`, so every deploy published the unlaunched cut half at
# /foldbox/_offline-check.html, a plain 200. Nothing in the print-only bundle leaked; the
# whole app was simply sitting next to it as a static file.
_offline-check.html
*.offline.html
dist-offline/
